; TEST: abort=1
;
; i40 2^32 * 2^32 = 2^64, signed: the same product through `imul`.
; Abort kind 1, the numeric trap (prelude/README.md) -- the shared
; `bfausr_trap`. If nothing traps the function returns 7.
;
; THE CASE THE COMPARE MISSES (ssa-ir.md 2.2, wire-codec.md D5): at 33..63
; bits the 64-bit product can overflow. 2^32 * 2^32 = 2^64 leaves raw 0 in
; rax, 0 normalises to 0, and the compare passes -- so `mul` there also traps
; on the 64-bit flag (`imul`'s OF). trap_mul_u40_2p64.ir is the unsigned twin.
;
; Mutation (run): the 33..63-bit flag check dropped -> exit 7.

functio @initium (ptr) -> u8 {
b0:
%0 = param ptr 0
%1 = iconst i40 4294967296
%2 = iconst i40 4294967296
%3 = mul i40 %1 %2
%4 = iconst u8 7
ret %4
}
